.TH 3DMOUSE-AGENT 1 2026-11-10 "3dmouse-linux 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
3dmouse-agent \- 3DMouse Linux session agent (profiles, buttons, focus)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B 3dmouse-agent
.RB [ \-\-debug ]
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The per-user agent loads profiles from
.IR $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/3dmouse-linux/ ,
follows the focused application, and pushes the matching profile to
.BR 3dmoused (8).
It also runs button actions (keys, mouse buttons, macros, launch) and desktop scroll emulation.
It stops all injection while the session is locked.
It runs as the user unit
.IR 3dmouse-agent.service ,
bound to
.IR graphical-session.target .
Clients such as
.BR 3dmouse-config (1)
and
.BR 3dmousectl (1)
connect to
.IR $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/3dmouse/agent.sock ,
which is mode 0600.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.B THREEDMOUSE_BROKER_SOCKET, THREEDMOUSE_AGENT_SOCKET, THREEDMOUSE_CONFIG_DIR
override the default paths.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR 3dmousectl (1),
.BR 3dmoused (8)
